'''Electrical Cord''' (Japanese: '''エレキコード''' ''Electric Cord'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=If the {{e|Lightning}} Pokémon this card is attached to is in the Active Spot and is Knocked Out by damage from an attack from your opponent's Pokémon, move 2 {{e|Lightning}} Energy from that Pokémon and attach 1 Energy each to 2 of your Benched Pokémon.
}}

